  "bodyHash": "50594de06feca82c",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f00\"><strong>MOA DECOR：電子產品</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><em>這是一款裝飾模組，旨在為您的建築增添新的節日主題物品。目前已有數個模組提供家具，本模組旨在成為它們的又一補充，因為您可以找到數百種不同的物品與元素來裝飾您的世界。作為&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>MOA DECOR</em><em>&nbsp;系列目錄中的另一個模組。</em></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/892/moa-electronicos10.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1362\" height=\"950\"></em></strong></span></span></p>\n<h3><strong>合成</strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/880/c-electronicos-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"482\" height=\"230\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">模組中的所有物品均可在生存模式取得。要開始製作這些物品，您必須在工作台放置<strong>紅色染料</strong>與一顆綠寶石，如此即可獲得<strong>9 顆電子寶石</strong>。接著將它們與其他材料合成，便能取得各類裝飾品。<strong>總計有 150 種不同的物品！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/881/c-electronicos-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"228\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><strong>範例：</strong>若您想取得 GameCube 模型，進行合成時必須具備一顆電子寶石，此外還需該物品所需的額外材料，此處包含鐵錠、鐵粒、線、青金石以及 4 個紅色染料。還有部分次要合成配方是透過組合兩種不同模型的物品所衍生。在這種情況下則不需使用寶石，因為它已在先前的合成步驟中使用過了。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/882/moa-electronicos1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1473\" height=\"553\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/883/moa-electronicos2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1473\" height=\"561\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/884/moa-electronicos3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1473\" height=\"553\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/885/moa-electronicos4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1473\" height=\"553\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/886/moa-electronicos5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1473\" height=\"553\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/887/moa-electronicos6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1473\" height=\"553\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/888/moa-electronicos7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1473\" height=\"553\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/894/moa-electronicos11.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1473\" height=\"553\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/890/moa-electronicos9.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1473\" height=\"553\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/889/moa-electronicos8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1473\" height=\"553\"></span></p>\n<h2><em><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><u>注意：</u></strong>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">為了獲得更完整的體驗，建議您瀏覽&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>MOA DECOR</strong>&nbsp;<strong>系列目錄</strong></span>中的其他模組，那裡有更多可與本模組互補的分類。</span></em></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-cookery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/472/638039093834758638.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-art\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/441/638039045898196915.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-science\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/488/638039109952819535.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-toys\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/495/638039124454094910.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-bath\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/808/248/638178193015946116.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-lights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/853/442/638257035280816288.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-garden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/872/565/638291506409003759.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-holidays\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/885/795/638321626215674397.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-electronics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/990/90/638503048724039895.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p>",
